<title>JAPAN: Nanbu Plastics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nanbu Plastics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.75		vs	    7.43</p>
<p> Operating	  257    million    vs	  228    million</p>
<p> Current	    300    million    vs	  222    million</p>
<p> Net		  126    million    vs	  100    million</p>
<p> EPS		   21.66 yen	  vs	   21.83 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   5 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nanbu Plastics Co Ltd supplies resin products to the housing, airconditioning and copy machine industries.</p>
